# Never pull these back from the org: access is granted through permission sets and groups
# (docs/engineering/code-review-rules.md SEC-06).
**/profiles/**
**/settings/**
**/*.profile-meta.xml
# A profile the build itself owns (for example, the one an external-user licence requires) is
# deployed only when the project records it under SEC-06; un-ignore it here with its exact path:
# !force-app/distributor/profiles/<Profile Name>.profile-meta.xml
package.xml
.sf/
.sfdx/

# IDE and tooling files
/.illuminatedCloud/
**/*.ts
**/tsconfig*.json
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/eslint.config.*
**/graphql.config.yml
# Placeholder files that keep empty folders in git
**/.gitkeep

# Third-party code in force-app/distributor/vendor (docs/engineering/architecture.md §5): its licences and notes stay in Git and are never deployed
**/vendor/**/LICENSE*
**/vendor/**/*.md
# Jest tests of the Lightning web components (docs/engineering/architecture.md §4.5): run with `npm test`, never deployed
**/__tests__/**
# LWC configuration files
**/jsconfig.json
**/.eslintrc.json
